screen 1280 800 dpi 1.0
# U37: CorruptDisplayItem on a rare ring (the "Corrupted" source, two implicit slots). Open the
# first implicit dropdown and hover an entry (the tooltip: the mod lines and
# AddModComparisonTooltip with replaceImplicits through the calc), pick it (the selFunc:
# buildCorruptLists, so the second dropdown loses that mod's group), pick a second implicit,
# hover the Corrupt button (its tooltip: corruptItem(true) through AddItemTooltip), switch the
# sort to the second stat (applySort: getSortValue through calcFunc for every entry, the stable
# re-sort, the lists rebuilt with the selections kept, UpdateSearch), reopen the first dropdown,
# then Corrupt (SetDisplayItem of the corrupted item, ClosePopup). Runs once (the popup is
# centred, and the power sort calls the calc once per implicit on each side).
#! u37-expect display: Blight Whorl, Steel Ring
#! u37-expect Adding this mod will give
#! u37-expect increased Attributes
fixture userdir=user
frames 2
load-build "Builds/u37_items.xml"
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press 3
key-up CTRL
